  "about": "Labeled verdict eval for Agent Proceed's verifying agent (the auditor). Each case is one agent order at Northwind Outfitters: what the shopper specified (only these fields are checked; anything absent is unspecified), what the agent actually ordered, and the verdict a merchant should get, labeled from the stated rules before running anything. Products, prices, shipping and formal return terms are the live Northwind catalog (Supabase products table, read 2026-11-12). Run: npm run eval:verdict",
