    "Decisions rest only on consumer-specified parameters; an unspecified field is skipped and never counted as a mismatch.",
    "Decision-grade attributes are budget (order total, item + shipping), merchant and returns; a mismatch on one of them that is not clearly fraud is Review Required.",
    "Clearly wrong or suspicious orders are Hold for Suspicion: far over budget, wrong category, an unknown merchant, a record that does not verify.",
    "Pass only when the order matches every specified parameter."
